stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: App states for Create lesson
    accDescr: CloudLessonViewModel phases from tapping Create lesson to an opened lesson, including consent, polling and failure messages.
    [*] --> idle: project ready with prepared media and no active job
    idle --> submitting: Create lesson
    submitting --> needsConsent: no consent, or 403 consent_required
    needsConsent --> idle: Not now
    needsConsent --> submitting: Allow, PUT consent
    submitting --> building: 202 job queued
    submitting --> failed: 409, 422 too long, 429 daily limit
    building --> building: poll every 15 s, stage text
    building --> downloading: job succeeded with lessonId
    building --> failed: lesson_rejected or job failed
    idle --> downloading: project already has latestLessonId
    downloading --> ready: files verified and bundle loads
    downloading --> failed: hash, size or contract mismatch
    failed --> submitting: try again
    ready --> [*]: Open lesson in PackageLessonView
